        {
          "id": "72f91782-7514-30b9-b3a2-842d389859a8",
          "content": {
            "id": "72f91782-7514-30b9-b3a2-842d389859a8",
            "contentType": "VIDEO",
            "title": "Don't be a tech-only portfolio right now, Edward Jones CEO explains",
            "description": "<p>After Big Tech players <a data-i13n=\"cpos:1;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/news/alphabet-stock-jumps-as-q3-earnings-revenue-surpass-wall-streets-expectations-205108602.html\">Alphabet</a> (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:2;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/GOOG\">GOOG</a>, <a data-i13n=\"cpos:3;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/GOOGL\">GOOGL</a>), <a data-i13n=\"cpos:4;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/news/meta-stock-sinks-after-tax-hit-weighs-on-earnings-company-touts-notably-larger-ai-investments-in-year-ahead-201015549.html\">Meta Platforms</a> (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:5;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/META\">META</a>), <a data-i13n=\"cpos:6;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/news/microsoft-tops-q1-expectations-as-cloud-shines-but-stock-tumbles-151933788.html\">Microsoft</a> (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:7;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/MSFT\">MSFT</a>), <a data-i13n=\"cpos:8;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/news/amazon-stock-surges-after-q3-earnings-beat-on-top-and-bottom-lines-and-aws-growth-sends-stock-higher-155934501.html\">Amazon</a> (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:9;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/AMZN\">AMZN</a>), and <a data-i13n=\"cpos:10;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/news/apple-beats-on-q4-expectations-stock-rises-on-strong-outlook-despite-poor-china-sales-203020199.html\">Apple</a> (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:11;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/AAPL\">AAPL</a>) all reported their latest earnings results this week, how should investors be approaching risk tolerance and diversification in their portfolios?</p>\n<p>Edward Jones CEO and managing partner Penny Pennington discusses what she is seeing in market trends (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:12;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/%5EDJI?p=%5EDJI&.tsrc=fin-srch\">^DJI</a>, <a data-i13n=\"cpos:13;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/%5EIXIC?p=%5EIXIC&.tsrc=fin-srch\">^IXIC</a>, <a data-i13n=\"cpos:14;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/%5EGSPC?p=%5EGSPC&.tsrc=fin-srch\">^GSPC</a>), especially as tech and AI continue to dominate headlines.</p>\n<p>To watch more expert insights and analysis on the latest market action, check out more\u00a0<a data-i13n=\"cpos:15;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/videos/series/morning-brief/\">Morning Brief</a>.</p>",
            "summary": "After Big Tech players Alphabet (GOOG, GOOGL), Meta Platforms (META), Microsoft (MSFT), Amazon (AMZN), and Apple (AAPL) all reported their latest earnings results this week, how should investors be approaching risk tolerance and diversification in their portfolios? Edward Jones CEO and managing partner Penny Pennington discusses what she is seeing in market trends (^DJI, ^IXIC, ^GSPC), especially as tech and AI continue to dominate headlines. To watch more expert insights and analysis on the latest market action, check out more&nbsp;Morning Brief.",
