          "content": {
            "id": "7675724b-0c7d-32bd-9c96-54336515bedd",
            "contentType": "VIDEO",
            "title": "Amazon stock surges on AWS growth, Apple gains on iPhone outlook",
            "description": "<p>Amazon (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:1;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/AMZN\">AMZN</a>) and Apple (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:2;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/AAPL\">AAPL</a>) were the latest \"Magnificent Seven\" (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:3;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/MAGS\">MAGS</a>) names to report earnings results this week, following Meta (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:4;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/META\">META</a>), Alphabet (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:5;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/GOOG\">GOOG</a>, <a data-i13n=\"cpos:6;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/GOOGL\">GOOGL</a>), and Microsoft (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:7;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/MSFT\">MSFT</a>).</p>\n<p>Yahoo Finance Tech Editor <a data-i13n=\"cpos:8;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/author/daniel-howley/\">Dan Howley</a> recaps Amazon and Apple earnings.</p>\n<p>To watch more expert insights and analysis on the latest market action, check out more <a data-i13n=\"cpos:9;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/videos/series/morning-brief/\">Morning Brief</a>.</p>",
